  "content": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Consider the following grammar:"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\nS  a A a \\vert  b { \\cal B } b  \\varepsilon\\tag{25}\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\nA \\to C | a\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\n\\left| B \\to C \\right| \\boldsymbol { b }\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\nC \\to C D E { \\mid } \\varepsilon\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\nD \\to A \\mid B \\mid a b\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "i) Are there any useless symbols? Eliminate them if so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "ii) Eliminate ε -productions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "iii) Eliminate unit productions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "iv) Put the grammar into CNF."
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\nL = \\{ a ^ { n } b ^ { j } c ^ { k } \\mid k = j n \\}\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\n\\Sigma = \\{ a , b , c \\}\\tag{10}\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    }
  ],
